{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_moeshd_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_moeshd_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "生意场",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_moeshd_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7854504b731dd4e89f99c9048ce7ca359e5a2bf0a71a26a31d67a691bc21aa63",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使，可颂有回你消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，她说可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然她说过公司爆仓的话我们可以先把货物存放在这里，但还是说一下为好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，这个购物节大促销活动搞得公司仓库里面堆得满满当当，连个下脚的地方都腾不出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，好久都没有这样忙碌过了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到可颂的房间看起来普普通通，底下却有这么大一间仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和我提过这件事。说自己租了两层楼，一层住人，一层用来放东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么多货物，她都分门别类放得整整齐齐，一眼望过去让人心情都变得舒畅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水果罐头的话，我看看......工艺品、日用品、服饰、食物，应该是放在这里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......旁边这一摞箱子是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "美施保养油......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使姐，我一接到你的消息就回来了！怎么样，你们找到存放的地方了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到是找到了......我刚刚看到了很多保养油堆在那里，怎么，你这么快就把货买到手了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还有剩的钱吗？不是上个月才管我借了一笔钱购入布料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是之前囤积的旧版啦。我打算将这些库存转手卖出去，这样就有资金可以购入新款了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会有人愿意买这些过时的产品吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然是今年年初的旧款，但还在保质期内，价格又比市面上的新款低，应该会有人愿意接手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年初？这家公司产品更新速度也太快了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年推出两个全新的版本，研发实力应该很雄厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果唱片公司一年内要我出两张唱片，我一定很难保证品质。但是隔行如隔山，我也不好说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安心啦，这家保养油我也一直在用，品质很不错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "机器出现锈蚀！设备磨损老化！附件运动干滞！你是不是束手无策？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，新款美施保养油来帮你，耐高温，耐氧化，高黏度，低杂质，是你最好的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新添加独特成分，让你的机械设备时刻保持光洁如新，五种功效，开启你的全新使用体验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在订购整套，更有隐藏款等你发现。永远，选择美施，永远，热爱生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂，我们能把广播关了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "美施为了做广告真是下了血本，真是每时每刻都逃不过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "美施现推出和龙门著名匠人李锤锤联名的限量款保养油，网店门店均有销售。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前一百位订购者将获得我们赠送的李锤锤同款签名机修工具套餐，请速速拨打我们的订购热线吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的男声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是李锤锤，美施，大师的品质之选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？这不是那位视频网站上很火的机修大师吗？想不到他居然会选择和美施联名推出保养油产品，看来新款产品在他那里很受青睐啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的难道不是用户的口碑吗？一个大师也说明不了什么吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "排队购买这款产品的人真的非常多，从街头一直排到街尾，火爆程度简直远超我的想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种不愁销路的货物怎么想都得囤一点啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，它是不愁销路，可你的旧库存呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，别提了，来找我的商家像是说好了一样，都出了很低的价格，应该是吃准了我急用钱要在短时间内出手，所以才敢压价到这么低吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你怎么想，要不要卖给他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这周内如果没有其他人联系我的话，也只能这样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做生意难免有亏损的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你是安慰我吗？能天使姐~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，看前面不要看我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "香氛产品清仓大甩卖，买不了吃亏买不了上当，种种香型一应俱全，统统跳楼价，有意者请拨打xxxxxxxx，鼻尖芬芳，等待您的联络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，看起来还有一个可怜的家伙和我一样为仓库里的存货而发愁啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的笑容看起来非常勉强啊，可颂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车载广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燕麦奶配咖啡，让你的生活更健康，更美好。有时候，一加一，不只是二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，现在的广告越来越烦，越来越离谱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......可我觉得很有道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燕麦奶配咖啡让你的生活更美好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，是他说的最后一句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一加一，不只是二？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，请稍等下，鼻尖芬芳的负责人就在里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张先生，有一位小姐早上预约了和您会面，请问您现在有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请她进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，请进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张先生您好，冒昧来访我很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，没关系，小姐，该怎么称呼你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂，叫我可颂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂小姐，请问你今天造访是为了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是这样的，我有一批旧版美施保养油亟待出售，但是积压在仓库里很难找到合适的买家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想你误会了，本公司并不需要保养油，如你所见，我们自己的产品也积压在仓库里难以销售。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（伸出手指晃晃）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，我并不是来推销自己的货物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......那你是来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是来寻求和您合作的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我很心动，但实话说，我不觉得你像是有什么厉害的销售渠道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张先生您的眼光很准啊，不过我提供的不是渠道，而是策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，策略？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，一种可以让我们双方共赢的策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捆绑销售你我的库存商品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过时的保养油和过时的香氛产品，感觉这是一个注定会被消费者摒弃的组合啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我库存的保养油气味有些刺鼻，配合香氛产品使用，刚刚好可以优化使用体验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我注意到您的香氛产品有着众多的香型，这就是关键所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然保养油加香氛的组合单一，但是因为贵公司产品香型繁多，所以简单的组合有着很多不一样的搭配方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "包装还可以不写明香型，让客户随机购买，增加趣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（赞许地点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻烦问下，张先生，贵公司的产品有没有哪一款是相对受欢迎的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玫瑰香型卖得最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那赠品就是它了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "销量最好的东西做赠品，这不符合常理吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会，获得赠品的条件可是集齐其他几种香型组合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——但是玫瑰香型库存较少，到时候要是不够赠送怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，那就只好把它作为奖品了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每集齐一套香型组合，便赠送一次抽奖机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我懂了，我这边有些零零碎碎的东西可以作为感谢奖，二等奖和三等奖可以分别送保养油和香氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一等奖嘛，让我再想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，一等奖我可以提供，虽然很心痛，但是为了生意，我愿意割爱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是大帝先生的签名海报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗？！这是可以送的东西？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......没错，是我收藏了很久的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耶，去年压箱底的最佳员工奖终于派上用场了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂小姐，听到你这一番话，我茅塞顿开，可是这后续的利润分成怎么算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我司的香氛产品会在销售中占大头，理应拿多一份吧，你看......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在谈这个为时尚早啦，张先生，我们还是先制订更详细的销售方案吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，这是我的名片，你随时联系我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张先生，作为交换，这是我的名片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么啦，张先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "张先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，就是从来没见过这么......可爱的名片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，让人印象深刻嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你终于回来了，谈得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常好，但是最后如何分成还没有谈拢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或许，我现在可以给他打个电话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "电话号码是多少来着，让我看看名片夹，服装店、电器店、农产品店、理发店......啊，鼻尖芬芳，在这里，找到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你这名片夹摊开来都拖地了，不是，你这会儿打给他是已经有详细方案了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "详细方案？现在谈这个为时尚早啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，请问是张先生吗？早上我刚刚联系过您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，没错，我是可颂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这边的货物已经清点完毕了，随时可以送去进行包装，不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过刚刚有位机修店的采购负责人找到了我，她似乎对我的保养油很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......是这样的，她出了理想的价格，希望我能将这批保养油转手卖给她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，我还没有答应，我当然是希望能和贵司这样规模更大的企业合作，但是嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我清楚，但生意场上这些都是难免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了，张先生，她追过来了，您稍等下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这家伙的演技也太纯熟了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（虚按话筒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！女士您真的要买全部吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，这样真的不好，我都答应和别人的商品捆绑销售了。哎呀，这不是出不出更高价的问题呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这实在是太为难我了。急用也......不太合适吧......好吧好吧，我会考虑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（松开话筒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张先生，让您久等了，真是太不好意思了，刚刚那位采购负责人一直缠着我不放，他们好像接了一个很大的项目，需要很多保养油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您刚刚是说要提高我这边的利润分成吗？哎呀，这怎么好意思呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很感谢您愿意让步，那真是太好了，谢谢您！明天早上您有空继续谈谈吗？那好，明天见了，张先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谈妥了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算一算到时候不仅有资金进购新货，给空的还款也不成问题，真是万幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂，你有考虑过去演艺圈发展事业吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不划算，不考虑。等等......你不会是认真的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耸肩）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨......简直是意想不到的顺利啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（看着玻璃上映出的自己）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，你不赚钱谁赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿咻！这是今天卖掉的最后一箱了，数数看......还剩两箱，不错，这次还没有售罄就已经赚回本了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我并不理解你囤货的决定，现在看来确实很有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可是我从小被爹地妈咪训练出来的独到眼光，超级无敌准确，非常可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "经商世家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......算是吧，我从小长在爹地妈咪的小卖店，耳濡目染，多多少少是沾染了他们的想法与习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那剩下的保养油你找好买家了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两箱我打算留下自用，感觉客户的用后反馈都不错，是品质上乘的好东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以给我一瓶吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你一箱都没问题，随便拿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（仔细查看包装）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "配方，我得看看铳械能不能使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对哦，之前一直忙着卖货，也没仔细研究下新款保养油里面到底添加了什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前的空瓶子还没有扔，可以拿过来对比着看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拿回来了！你来看看......他们到底加了什么厉害的成分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先是百分之七十五的矿物基础油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没变啊......添加剂呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有黏度改进剂、抗氧化剂、抗腐蚀剂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶，也没啥变化啊。什么嘛，配料都是一模一样的，广告里说的新成分呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，好像后面确实有一种新加的材料......玫瑰醚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是什么东西？等我搜索一下......玫瑰醚，香味物质，有着玫瑰的清新香气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，所谓的新款保养油就只是多添加了一种香精吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么......感觉被摆了一道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说明你和商家的想法不谋而合啊，好事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拍拍可颂的肩膀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，晚上还有订单需要派送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂，你不走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个月后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这地方怎么老在排长队，过了街角都看不到头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "估计又是什么新品的发售日吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屏幕上的广告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全新美施保养油首日上市，个性化定制服务，彰显自我，十二种香型搭配，提升体验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屏幕上的广告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在订购，更有与专业香氛品牌鼻尖芬芳合作推出的神秘香型赠送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屏幕上的广告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永远，选择美施，永远，热爱生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这家店的保养油不是上个月才出了新款吗？怎么这么快就推陈出新了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你猜，队伍里面有没有可颂在排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然猜她在，是再合理不过的事情。但是嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜她不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可颂之前一直很失落呢，约她去购物街不去，美食街也不去，连自己的生意都懒得打理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道，她的小仓库里面已经变得空荡荡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来她的确因为那件事深受打击啊，想来也是，忙到头发现自己被商家牵着鼻子走，怎么想都很沮丧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那家伙不会从此就放弃自己的生意了吧......？说起来好几天都没有见过她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我也不知道，但我有点想念原来那个风风火火的她了，是盈是亏，第二天都能活力满满。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是啊......不过，鼻尖芬芳这个牌子怎么这么熟悉啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，能天使，你看，我猜对了，可颂没在队伍里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好啊，诸位，结束了一天的工作，要不要来一份最新口味的脆骨肉丸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你俩要回去吗？上车吧，顺路捎你们一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（侧过身子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯咳，你有发现什么新东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......换新发型了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我啊，是我后面的橱窗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——原来是那个啊，嗨，我一周前就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是今天刚推出的产品吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是美施的内部消息，我帮他们介绍了不错的合作方，就是那位张先生。为了答谢，他们提前给我开通了新款的特惠购买渠道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得我觉得这个名字这么耳熟......你已经囤好新款货物了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，我拒绝了他们的特惠渠道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？这可是一个赚得盆满钵满的好机会啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不打算掺和这些了，我已经有了全新的销售计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算卖什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，可颂，这个脆骨肉丸也太好吃了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
